# RaceDay API Endpoint Plan

## Section B – API Endpoint Plan

| HTTP Method | Route | Description | Role Required | Request Body | Expected Response |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| POST | `/api/auth/register` | Registers a new participant or organiser account. | Public | FirstName, LastName, Email, Phone, Role | 201 Created – Account created; 400 Bad Request |
| POST | `/api/auth/login` | Authenticates an organiser or participant. | Public | Email, Password | 200 OK – Login successful; 401 Unauthorized |
| GET | `/api/profile/{id}` | Retrieves a participant or organiser profile. | Any logged in | None | 200 OK – Profile returned; 404 Not Found |
| PUT | `/api/profile/participant/{id}` | Updates a participant's profile information. | Participant | FirstName, LastName, Email, Phone | 200 OK – Profile updated; 404 Not Found |
| PUT | `/api/profile/organiser/{id}` | Updates an organiser's profile information. | Organiser | FirstName, LastName, Email, Phone | 200 OK – Profile updated; 404 Not Found |
| GET | `/api/events` | Retrieves a list of upcoming RaceDay events. | Public | None | 200 OK – List of events |
| GET | `/api/events/{id}` | Retrieves details of a specific event. | Public | None | 200 OK – Event details; 404 Not Found |
| POST | `/api/events` | Creates a new RaceDay event. | Organiser | OrganiserID, Name, Description, EventDate, Location, Status | 201 Created – Event created; 400 Bad Request |
| PUT | `/api/events/{id}` | Updates an existing event. | Organiser | Name, Description, EventDate, Location, Status | 200 OK – Event updated; 404 Not Found |
| DELETE | `/api/events/{id}` | Deletes an existing event. | Organiser | None | 204 No Content – Event deleted; 404 Not Found |
| GET | `/api/events/{eventId}/categories` | Retrieves all categories for a specific event. | Public | None | 200 OK – Categories returned |
| POST | `/api/events/{eventId}/categories` | Creates a category for an event. | Organiser | Name, DistanceKm, EntryFee | 201 Created – Category created; 400 Bad Request |
| PUT | `/api/categories/{id}` | Updates an existing event category. | Organiser | Name, DistanceKm, EntryFee | 200 OK – Category updated; 404 Not Found |
| DELETE | `/api/categories/{id}` | Deletes an event category. | Organiser | None | 204 No Content – Category deleted; 404 Not Found |
| POST | `/api/enrolments` | Enrols a participant into an event category. | Participant | ParticipantID, EventID, CategoryID | 201 Created – Enrolment created; 409 Conflict |
| GET | `/api/enrolments/participant/{participantId}` | Retrieves all enrolments for a participant. | Participant | None | 200 OK – Enrolments returned; 404 Not Found |
| GET | `/api/events/{eventId}/enrolments` | Retrieves all participants enrolled in an event. | Organiser | None | 200 OK – Enrolments returned; 404 Not Found |
| DELETE | `/api/enrolments/{id}` | Cancels a participant's enrolment. | Participant | None | 204 No Content – Enrolment cancelled; 404 Not Found |
| POST | `/api/results` | Records a participant's result after an event. | Organiser | EnrolmentID, FinishTime, Position, ResultStatus | 201 Created – Result recorded; 400 Bad Request |
| GET | `/api/results/{id}` | Retrieves a specific race result. | Any logged in | None | 200 OK – Result returned; 404 Not Found |
| GET | `/api/participants/{participantId}/results` | Retrieves a participant's performance history. | Participant / Organiser | None | 200 OK – Results returned; 404 Not Found |
| PUT | `/api/results/{id}` | Updates an existing participant result. | Organiser | FinishTime, Position, ResultStatus | 200 OK – Result updated; 404 Not Found |

---

## API Endpoint Summary

The RaceDay API provides endpoints for authentication, user profiles, events, event categories, participant enrolments and race results. Public users can view events and categories, while authenticated participants and organisers have access to functions based on their roles.

### Authentication
- Register a new account
- Login to the system

### User Profile
- View participant or organiser profile
- Update participant profile
- Update organiser profile

### Events
- View all events
- View a specific event
- Create an event
- Update an event
- Delete an event

### Categories
- View event categories
- Create a category
- Update a category
- Delete a category

### Enrolments
- Enrol a participant
- View participant enrolments
- View event enrolments
- Cancel an enrolment

### Results
- Record race results
- View individual results
- View participant performance history
- Update race results
